    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb, Just Keep Going</strong></h2><br>This is a game where you climb, using jumps, sprint, and slows, while being careful not to fall.<br>You can save it, but it will be deleted once you load it.<br>The only thing you can do to escape from a world where one day, suddenly, no one is around is to climb.<br><br>I don't know why I'm here, but when I realized it, there was no one around, and the town wasn't supposed to be this small.<br><br>For some reason, something is floating in the sky, and it looks like a road somewhere.<br><br>Is it all I can do to climb? I don't know, but that's all I can do now. I'll try to go as far as I can.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb, Just Keep Going</strong></h2><br>This is a game where you climb, using jumps, sprint, and slows, while being careful not to fall.<br>You can save it, but it will be deleted once you load it.<br>The only thing you can do to escape from a world where one day, suddenly, no one is around is to climb.<br><br>I don't know why I'm here, but when I realized it, there was no one around, and the town wasn't supposed to be this small.<br><br>For some reason, something is floating in the sky, and it looks like a road somewhere.<br><br>Is it all I can do to climb? I don't know, but that's all I can do now. I'll try to go as far as I can.",
    "short_description": "This is a game where you climb by jumping, sprinting, and slowing, while being careful not to fall. The only thing you can do to escape from a world where one day suddenly no one is left is to climb. If you keep climbing without giving up, you will definitely be able to escape.",
